    <string name="journal_titre">Help improve the corrector</string>
    <string name="journal_explication">There is no corpus of real Kabyle spelling errors. When you keep a form over the one suggested, you teach us something no test can: which error actually occurs, and which form a speaker judges correct.</string>
    <string name="journal_activer">Record the forms I choose</string>
    <string name="journal_detail">Nothing is recorded until you turn this on. The file stays on your device.</string>
    <string name="journal_diffusion">Allow my contributions to be published in a freely reusable Kabyle corpus</string>
    <string name="journal_diffusion_detail">A separate question on purpose: letting us use your file and letting us republish it are not the same permission.</string>
